description: Never use left-edge accent rails or vertical colour bars on cards/popovers
alwaysApply: true
---

# No left accent rails

Do **not** use a vertical colour strip / left-edge accent rail on cards, popovers, hover cards, dialogs, or list rows (e.g. `absolute left-0 w-[3px]`, coloured `border-l-*` as a decorative bar, or similar).

Prefer on-brand glass accents instead: soft washes, avatar/chip colour, sheen, inset wells, and butter/accent CTAs.
